step D: evaluating
triage: revise_rules: The game file works as specified, but one fixed choice dominates. Always taking the first option wins about 90% of decided matches from either seat. Always taking the last option (bidding the maximum T) almost always loses. Because raises may jump straight to any quantity up to T, most bids are wildly false, so calling Dudo or making the smallest bid wins without any thought.
